atch"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.third_step/preferred"],"comparison":"For s,eta>=0 and ThirdDerivativeBounded, substituting D=-eta polar(grad f W) gives decrease -eta*nuclearNorm(grad f W), signed eta^2*hessianQuadratic/2 and remainder s eta^3*r sqrt(r)/6. No positivity of realized curvature is assumed.","id":"declaration:OracleTemplate.Muon.third_step","source":["src_d10b45f9499f92f0019af6af","src_eb5f01ec0f02009d7ff96632","src_df08bb50e67a10b2d30e63b5","src_074c5fe6502973673206492d","src_911905ebd9f09d3ada549535","src_0301bcaa450fe89da40804ce","src_6b7eeaeef7e58ae8bf0269bd","src_8538c20703700b519e9221d4","src_8b67c5ea838239ee92a82011","src_de39494f3e4d6fd57a732238","src_68fa2f6de1cbb3a58c268311","src_6b585430126ab8429d92be6c","src_ba3620fcc3457d2bc004d54b","src_c5a1955f8766c55848ed274a","src_8bbe28ee3a4ef41bf6db1325","src_508872c513b6b52989726761","src_0c59e263a78118f34cda6550"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.MuonThirdOrder.guarantee/preferred"],"comparison":"Under original validity, third-derivative boundedness and a bounded-below objective, the complete source Guarantee holds for the exact SimplifiedMuon gradient trajectory. It retains the raw bound for every signed J and the separately conditional J>0 tuning/complexity clauses, without adding the user-approved Jbar assumption to the source theorem.","id":"declaration:OracleTemplate.MuonThirdOrder.guarantee","source":["src_d10b45f9499f92f0019af6af","src_eb5f01ec0f02009d7ff96632","src_df08bb50e67a10b2d30e63b5","src_074c5fe6502973673206492d","src_911905ebd9f09d3ada549535","src_0301bcaa450fe89da40804ce","src_6b7eeaeef7e58ae8bf0269bd","src_8538c20703700b519e9221d4","src_8b67c5ea838239ee92a82011","src_de39494f3e4d6fd57a732238","src_68fa2f6de1cbb3a58c268311","src_6b585430126ab8429d92be6c","src_ba3620fcc3457d2bc004d54b","src_c5a1955f8766c55848ed274a","src_8bbe28ee3a4ef41bf6db1325","src_508872c513b6b52989726761","src_0c59e263a78118f